# BUSY variant: after Chapter I arrival (~62s), advance RIGHT with jump pulses
# (bit5=Action, 0x020) to clear terrain — the first stone bridge blocked a
# walk-only draft at SPEEDRUN ~0:51 — and sword swings for enemies. Requires
# GMLOADER_GODMODE=1 (skip obj_player collision events) so contact damage
# cannot kill or knock back the scripted hero.
